Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(庞蒂弗拉克特城堡 约克郡 英格兰北部)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:13.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(纽瓦克农场 布兰顿总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:07.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(西班牙属荷兰)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:27.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有何消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些世事如同疟疾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This matter hangs like a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:32.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时好时坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one day good, another bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:36.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王以许诺宽恕与惩罚恩威并施 加之王室军威的重压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the promise of a pardon, and the threat of an advancing royal army,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:39.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}林肯郡叛军业已遣散回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the rebels in Lincolnshire have dispersed and gone home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:41.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约克郡呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in Yorkshire?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:53.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在约克郡以及整个北部地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In Yorkshire and the whole North we are facing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们面临前所未有的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the most dangerous insurrection that has ever been seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:59.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛军3天前攻占了约克郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebels entered the town of York three days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:03.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛军大肆庆祝 有人说他们即将向南部挺进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and celebrated mass in the cathedral; some say they intend to march South.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"吾王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.49,0:02:28.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"臣有急情告禀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I write to you on an urgent matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:35.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"流言传说 求恩叛军已逼近臣据守之庞蒂弗拉克特城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"We've had word that a pilgrim army is marching"on to Pontefract Castle, which is under my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:41.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"恕臣直言 如无援军 我等将无力抵御叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I am compelled to tell you that I can't defend this castle"without more soldiers and arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:45.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"作为东部边陲守卫者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"As the warden of the East Marches
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:48.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"及陛下枢密院忠实成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a loyal member"of Your Majesty's council
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:53.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"臣伏祈陛下与'求恩者'开端谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I beg Your Majesty to consider negotiating with these pilgrims.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:59.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"吾王麾下谦卑忠仆达西叩上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remain your humble and obedient servant. Darcy."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么 你发现了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it? What have you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小块碎骨 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A splinter of bone, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:21.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你曾经说不过是伤口溃疡 很容易治愈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You told me before it was an ulcer. That it was easily cured!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:25.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 像这样的伤势… 陛下 - 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- A wound like this, Your Majesty... - Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:27.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实你根本就不懂 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't know what it is, do you? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:31.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下切莫担心 小人将施以泥敷剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty must not be alarmed. We shall apply a poultice to draw
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}取出伤口表面其他碎骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}any more splinters to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:38.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后另寻良方一劳永逸治愈陛下伤势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we shall look to other remedies to heal permanently Your Majesty's wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我就像一个傻瓜一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You treat me like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们这些对我都像傻瓜一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone here treats me like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:47.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:49.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 给我滚出去 - 陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Get out! - Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唧唧歪歪的江湖郎中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're quacks and charlatans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:57.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不如我自己来另寻良方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will find my own remedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:20.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:22.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我前来取你所应允准备的军火枪炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was promised artillery when I arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:24.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我未见任何枪械\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I don't see any guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:26.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我们有枪械\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, we have guns
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:30.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们尚未找妥运送枪械之马匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we have not been unable to find any horses or drays to transport them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许您还未明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:37.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我此番前来所为国王最紧急事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am about the King's most urgent business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果区区马匹你都不能为国王征调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you cannot commandeer some horses for his Majesty's use then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎配伦敦市长之职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how can you call yourself Mayor of London?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:48.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 在下不想强行征用民众马匹而引发恐慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, I did not want to produce panic by forcing people to part with their horses or drays.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}IDIOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:55.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我命令你亲自在两日之内找齐所需马匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I charge you personally to find enough horses within two days
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将枪械运至我军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and bring the guns on after our army
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:05:00.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则定然唯你是问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or God help me I will hold you to account.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自求多福吧 市长大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With any luck, Mr. Mayor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可别让我有机会把你送上刑场开膛破肚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will afterwards get the chance to see you disemboweled at Tyburn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 洛克福特女士 - 王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lady Rochford? - Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:23.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下仍需遵医嘱待在寝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the King is still confined to his chambers by his physicians' orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但转致歉意并望您安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but sends his regrets and hopes you are well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很为他担忧 特别在如此情形之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I worry for him so much. Especially at such a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下所忧极是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty is right to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:38.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些叛军都是彻头彻尾的恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These rebels are nothing but villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是被蛊惑的信徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are totally alienated from true religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:45.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会用武力使我们回到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want to take us back to the dark days
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑暗的无知迷信年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of ignorance and superstition. And by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:52.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我希望此事很快就可平定 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I hope to God they will soon be overcome. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:56.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛克福特女士 我要你替我办件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford,I have something I wish you to arrange for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:00.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信此事会让吾王万分欢愉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure it will give the King a great deal of pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My God, Lord Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多么骇人的情景啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a sight is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:34.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}平民聚众反叛吾王 不以大打旗号为耻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrant rebels against the King's Majesty brazenly bearing their badges of shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:37.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的确如此 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed so, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:41.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也没想到在我有生之年能目睹此等光景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never thought in all my long days to see such a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人意欲何为 向他们开火吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you going to do? Fire on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:48.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道的很清楚我几乎没几只枪炮可用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know very well I have almost no useful guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:51.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可您同样可以关门御敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could resist them all the same, and close your gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:54.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟此乃国王谕令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all those are the King's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:59.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有鉴于此 我想最好是先礼后兵举行对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As to that, I think it better to talk to them first,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:04.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们既是英国同胞 也是主内肢体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as fellow Englishmen and fellow Christians.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:06.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将在门厅与他们首领会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll meet their leaders in the gatehouses,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在城堡墙外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}outside the castle walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卫兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Darcy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们抱着和平的诚意前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we come here in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:35.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 身为国王代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Aske.As the King's representative
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拥有对付你等之武力 可以重挫你等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have the means hereto hinder you and to do some injury to your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:45.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我等求恩巡礼初衷乃出于共善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord, we have embarked upon this Pilgrimage of Grace for the common good,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:50.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了上帝的爱 我们希望恢复神圣教堂 维护信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the love we bear to God's faith,our Holy Church and the maintenance of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:53.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为维护我们至尊国王的在世权柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the preservation of our sovereign King
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:57.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了清除那些血腥的罪恶官吏们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the expulsion of villain's blood and evil councilors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们意欲向国王陛下请愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We mean to petition the King's highness
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:04.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}促使停止对修道院的恶意毁灭与亵渎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to stop the woeful destruction of our monasteries and abbeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:08.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 你宣称忠于国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Aske, you claim to be loyal to the King
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:13.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你的实际行动却在反叛违背国王的权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but your very actions defy and deny the King's supremacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非也 大主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Archbishop,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:19.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王国之内 无人比我更忠于吾王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is no man now alive in England more loyal to the King than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:21.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}假以时日 我将证明我的忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust in time to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:25.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的起事之矛头所在并非吾王 只是意在清君侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our quarrel lies not with him, but onlywith those close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:31.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的天花乱坠 你这位高权重之辈更该受到谴责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's very well for you to sound so high and mighty, but you and your kind are also to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你不曾向国王建忠言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for not advising the King honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:38.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不揭露这些异端恶行横行 这才是真正对国王之大不敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about the spread of heresy and abuse throughout his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:42.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔与克朗默之流之恶行与亵渎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For what are Cromwell and Cranmer but heretics
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:45.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才是真正侵害王国之共善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and manifest abusers of this commonwealth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Darcy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:51.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如我所言 我们无意伤害任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I told you we mean no displeasure to any person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:54.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们但求一住所和前进通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We ask for shelter and free passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:56.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们此举乃是求恩 其承载着对上帝的誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All our pilgrims have taken an oath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:09:00.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勿因嫉恨而行罪恶奴役或屠戮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to slay or murder out of envy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:05.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但为了天下共善抛却了恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to put away fear for the commonwealth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:10.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高举着基督十字架与他们内心的信仰勇往直前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and march with the cross of Christand their heart's faith before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:15.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你试图阻止我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we will fight and die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将誓死战斗到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you seek to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:26.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想让你负责本城的防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am putting you in charge of the defenses here the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:29.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以设法强征些新丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall need to organize new levies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给所有的士绅大人们传令备战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send word to every lords and gentlemen to be ready with his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可随意向从伦敦塔索取所需军火物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take all the weapons,harness and ordnance you need from the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:39.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果需要 就尽管去购置更多军火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Buy more if you need to from the merchants in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此 我们目前很麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then it's true. We are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}IDIOT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:45.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下召见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty will receive you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:04.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚收到达西大人的信件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've just received a letter from Lord Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:10.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说叛军力量强大 他无法抵挡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says that he is in great danger from the rebels and cannot maintain his resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:15.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然如此 他控制着一个城堡 重要强大的关卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet he holds a castle. A great stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:19.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道那不意味着他可以抵挡住叛军吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he not mean to stand firm against these traitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:21.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我刚刚得知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, I've just been told
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:27.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一股数目庞大的叛军人马已经进入庞蒂弗拉克特城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the rebels have already entered the town of Pontefract with overwhelming numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庞蒂弗拉克特城堡乃是南北之门户所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pontefract is the gateway to the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}具有重大战略重要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has great strategic importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你立刻写信给达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will write a letter to Lord Darcy at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:51.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你告诉他 我要他守住城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will tell him that I expect him to hold that castle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不惜任何代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:11:00.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王室军队是什么情形 他们是否在粉碎叛军战斗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of the royal army?What are they doing to crush this rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:03.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵大人现在何方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is his Grace the Duke of Suffolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:06.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有那个混蛋什鲁斯伯里 我曾对他三令五申\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that bastard Shrewsbury! I told him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:11.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 这些人都在做什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What in God's name are these men doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlenman
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 约克郡的朋友们 - 达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Friends of York. Lord Darcy. - My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:35.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西和约克郡背叛了我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Darcy and York have betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:43.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我倒要看看他们还会到何等地步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we shall see what end they come to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何什鲁斯伯里和沙福克公爵尚未发动进攻？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why haven't Shrewsbury and Suffolk attacked yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:50.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听到的只有抱怨和借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I hear are their complaints and their excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:52.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们知道我怎么想吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们开始就连自己的影子都害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think they have become afraid of their own shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要御驾亲征北部地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a mind to go North myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:00.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来领军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll lead the army!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:07.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要亲自给这些混蛋和叛军血的教训 大开杀戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll teach these bastard ingrates and rebels a fearful bloody lesson in slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:19.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望陛下不是真的要亲自领军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish Your Majesty would not consider doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:21.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我太虚弱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you suppose I'm too feeble?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:27.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下千金之躯 何苦涉险与这些低贱平民叛乱之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I meant that Your Majesty's life is far too precious to be put at risk against such a common rabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:30.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 如果您前去 一定如猛虎入狼群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course if you chose to go, you would be like a lion among wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:34.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯爵士 我并不需要你来奉承我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Francis, I don't require you to flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不敢 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给沙福克公爵发一份直接了当的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send a plain message to Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:42.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}质问他们为什么违背我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask him why he refuses to obey my commands
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问他是否是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and ask him if he is a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 遵命 陛下 - 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty. - And Mr. Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果事情恶化 我很了解谁该被问罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If things go badly, I know well enough who to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:00.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我能做什么来减轻您的痛苦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I get Your Majesty anything for your pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:06.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 我相信你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I believe you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人 什鲁斯伯里伯爵驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, the Earl of Shrewsbury is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My Lord. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:42.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 解散 - 大人 - 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Men dismissed. - Your Grace. - Your Grace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:53.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们深陷困境 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We meet at a desperate moment, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要对付的不仅是叛军强盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not only are the rebel forces overwhelmingly strong against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:59.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且军心不齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but those men I do have I cannot altogether trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}许多士兵相信叛军是义举而且符合上帝意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many of them I swear think the rebels' quarrels to be good and godly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:10.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王仍然催促我们尽快出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still, the King has urged us to attack as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果陛下亲眼目睹现状将不会如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty would not do so if he saw our plight with his own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:19.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们几乎没有马夫 敌众我寡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have almost no horsemen,and those I do have are rather the flower of the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:23.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法去发动一场注定失败的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not possible your lordship to give battle knowing defeat to be a certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:27.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你有其他计划吗 - 我只能和他们谈判 - 谈判？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you have some other plan? - I intend to parley with them.- Parley?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:32.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我们首要任务是防止他们逃窜并向南部进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord,it's our first duty to stop them escaping and marching South.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:35.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果在谈判 他们就不会进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they are talking they are not marching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:37.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你去跟国王说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you must tell the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什鲁斯伯里的军队在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shrewsbury's forces are here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:51.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵在这里 离纽瓦克不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Suffolk's here, not far from Newark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:56.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看起来他们最初的企图是控制住沿着特伦特河的这条防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems likely that they had originally planned to hold a line here, along the River Trent,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:58.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阻挡我们向南部进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to block our advance southwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How strong are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:03.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 什鲁斯伯里有多少人？六千？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We think that Shrewsbury's men are 6000? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:05.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克人数更少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Suffolk's a lot less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也都缺少马匹和大炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They also lack horse and cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how many are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:16.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 据我统计 超过三万 - 三万？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- By my reckoning,somewhere over thirty thousand. - Thirty Thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:22.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在这里 在邓卡斯特有大量人马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have kept large forces here at Doncaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在杰福克斯修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Jervaux Abbey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:30.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我们目前包围了坎伯兰郡伯爵的斯基普顿城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we are presently laying siegeto the Earl of Cumberland's castle at Skipton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:35.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在顿河北部 我们基本完成了对乡村的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}North of the River Don, we have almost complete control of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:41.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们朝我们进军吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them come on to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有上帝在我们这一边 阿斯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With God on our side, Mr. Aske,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必胜无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真不幸啊 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:15:57.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抹些药膏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pour the ointment over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:06.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 味道像酸模 亚麻子？- 是药用植物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I smell sorrel and...linseed? - Meadowplant,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:09.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}碎珍珠粉 芸香和其他东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}crushed pearls, herb of grace, other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不再信任那个医生 我只得自寻良方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I concocted it myself. I don't trust my physicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挺住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你非常勇敢 米塞尔登女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're very brave, Lady Misseldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:20.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勇敢胜过我的将军们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Braver, I think, than my Captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:24.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但更加美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And much more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:35.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 撒上了 相信陛下会爽些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There, it's done. I trust Your Majesty is more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下希望我留下来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does Your Majesty wish me to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:07.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指望英格兰国王会认识到自己的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems we were wrong to suppose that the King of England
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:11.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与其对灵魂的危险看起来是个错误的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would realize his mistakes and the dangers to his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:14.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他反而还在继续支持克伦威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Instead he continues to encourage Cromwel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:19.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大肆破坏亵渎教堂 掠夺教会财物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to vandalize and defile the houses of God and steal their treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅仅出乎个人用途和喜好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all for his own use and pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:27.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过即使黑暗之中 也有一丝亮光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet, even in the darkness there is a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:33.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说 信徒的起义非常伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, this great uprising of the faithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:37.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 求恩巡礼 - 我也有所耳闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This Pilgrimage of Grace. - I have heard of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:39.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求恩者们打着耶稣基督的旗帜进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pilgrims who marched beneath the banner of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:44.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣父要你就此写个英文小册子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Holy Father asks you to write a pamphlet in English
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:48.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指责国王与其顾问们为异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}denouncing the King and his advisors as heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:51.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定 我这就去动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course. I will start work on it straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:54.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先别 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, No. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣父对你期盼良多 绝非仅仅你的署名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Holiness needs more from you than just your signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:18:03.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的举荐下 教皇已决定任命你为官方使节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my encouragement, he has decided to appoint you an official legate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:07.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将前去法国以及其他国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will travel to France and to the Low Countries
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:10.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会见皇帝与王公们的代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and meet representatives of the King and the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:18.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 主教大人 - 你要游说他们提供资金 武器和雇佣兵等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Eminence...? - You will persuade them to provide monies, arms and mercenaries
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:22.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来支援英国这次神圣的宗教圣战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to support this most Holy Crusade in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:27.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果这是教皇交给我的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that is what His Holiness asks me to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我会尽心完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then of course I will do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就如同像孝子侍奉父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like an obedient son to a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:38.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇陛下已经恩准册封你为红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Holiness has agreed to make you a Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此乃您的红衣主教方型帽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And here is your biretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:44.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:47.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不够格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:55.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换句话说 你宁可相信自己的判断高于圣父 教皇陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In other words, you prefer your own judgment to that of the Pope, your Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:59.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无疑您此举本想显示谦卑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt you suppose that makes you seem humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:05.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那却会成为对教皇傲慢之罪过 波尔神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But actually it is the sin of pride for the Pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:18.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵大人禀告他别无选择 只得暂时与叛军周旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Grace informs Your Majesty he has no choice in the matter but to treat with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:23.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他本欲对参与其事的当地士绅以叛乱治罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In so doing, he hopes to bring the nobles and the gentry to treachery
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:26.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但囿于目前情势只能恩泽广施实行宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and for their own sakes and their own interestst hey will disown the commons,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:30.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就如同林肯郡的方式一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if promised a pardon as in fact happened in Lincolnshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们不该被宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are not all to be pardoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:36.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头领不在内 永远不宽恕那些头领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the leaders. Never the leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:41.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵都开了些什么条件放他们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what terms does my Lord Suffolk intend to offer the commons to make them go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:47.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人并未详述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh... His Grace does not go into details,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:50.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但请陛下不必担心 他亲笔写道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but...to allay Your Majesty's fears,he writes, in his own hand:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:54.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"臣祈求陛下不必担心 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I beseech Your Majesty to take in good part whatever promises"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:56.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"在目前情势下我所虚与委蛇对他们的许诺"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I shall make to these rebels,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:59.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"而我事后将不受任何上述承诺之约束"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for surely I shall never keep any of them."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:35.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们这帮不满之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas, you unhappy men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:39.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么愚蠢的怪念头蛊惑了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What fancy, what folly has led and seduced you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:45.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居然如此对待你们最高贵 最正直之王公君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make this most shameful rebellion against our most noble and righteous king and sovereign?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:21:00.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不感觉羞耻吗 你怎能如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you not ashamed?How can you do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么胆敢冒犯尔等天然 救主之君王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not only giving offence to your natural sovereign Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:07.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迫使我们与你们与你们交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but giving us occasion to fight with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王热爱你等甚于王国任何其他地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that have loved you more than any other part of the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并始终像至亲好友般对待你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have always taken you for our best friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:17.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人 我们并无意冒犯国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, we mean no offence to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:24.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们只是请愿 谦卑而且恳切地希望能送呈陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we have a petition which we desire humbly to submit to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:30.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王国已经失去太多不应当失去的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the restoration of many things which have gone amiss in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:35.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要求恢复我们的修道院 以及我们传统的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We demand the restoration of our abbeys and our ancient rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:40.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重造能重视民众的诉求之新国会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a new Parliamentbe summoned to address the people's sincere grievances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:48.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此刻我无法答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can decide nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我提议休战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I propose a truce,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:58.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此期间 可请二位首领 前去当面向国王陈情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}during which time two of your captains can take your petition and present it to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他们回来之前我们保持休战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The truce to be maintained until they return.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西勋爵 可否一叙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Darcy, can we talk a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.59,0:22:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Darcy,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:33.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您应当比这里的任何人都更该报答陛下恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you more than anyone here has cause to be grateful to the King for his bounty,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下也一直对大人信赖并寄予厚望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the trust he reposes in you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.33,0:22:39.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且依旧如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would like to repose in you still..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:45.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我却发现您与这帮叛军沆瀣一气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet here I find you consorting with rebels and traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.81,0:22:50.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从我内心深处 我过去以及将来都永远忠于吾王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For my part I have been and always will be true to the King
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:55.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的真命天子 我过去曾与吾王情同父子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our sovereign Lord, as I was to his father before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如您所言非虚 依旧忠诚于王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you are as true and loyal as you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:23:00.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您大可向我们证明此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you can prove it to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.11,0:23:04.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是将叛军首领阿斯克的项上人头交来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by giving overyour Captain Mr. Aske into our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:07.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 这我不愿也不会去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, that I cannot and will not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.21,0:23:10.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于许诺坦诚相交之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For a man who promises to be true to someone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:14.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}背叛出卖才真可谓之叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then betrays him may truly be called a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:20.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty, the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Madam. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.09,0:23:40.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾看到陛下大为好转甚为欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It makes me happy to see you so much improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:42.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寡人新得很好的治疗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a good physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.67,0:23:44.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管如此 我还是希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless, I intend we shall visit the shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:47.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们尽快去造访托马斯·柏克特神殿并致谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Sir Thomas Becket and give our thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:53.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已安排了其他事宜 而这我满怀希望 可以使您欢愉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have arranged for something else which I hope,with all my heart, will make you very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.81,0:24:02.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 玛丽·都铎女士觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, the Lady Mary Tudor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.67,0:24:18.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求得到陛下祝福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask Your Majesty for His blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:21.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲生女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:26.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请允许我向珍王后陛下引见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I present you to Her Majesty Queen Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:34.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得你们当中有人曾热衷于提议处死我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember, some of you were desirous that I should put this jewel to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:45.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有我在 你已经安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got you, your safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.03,0:24:48.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好开心吧 玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be of good cheer, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.34,0:24:52.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从今往后 将不复再有针对你的敌意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For I swear nothing now will go against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.10,0:25:02.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.14,0:25:08.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你高兴吗 - 是的陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Are you happy? - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.81,0:25:12.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下已经同意给你在杭斯顿和格林威治宫安排居处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty has agreed to give you lodgings at Hampton Court and others at Greenwich Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.09,0:25:16.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都去看过 都很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen them both; they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.81,0:25:21.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对国王陛下和王后陛下感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am very grateful to His Majesty and to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.22,0:25:25.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个人都说我女儿纯真无邪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone says my daughter is innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说她未曾听说过任何污言秽语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she doesn't know any unclean or foul speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:31.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.07,0:25:35.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能相信任何人可以那么纯真无辜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe that anybody could be that innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.14,0:25:38.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去查探一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.89,0:25:50.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:57.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须对我当日行为道歉 期盼得到您的真心宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted to apologize for my behavior.I hope you can find it in your heart to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:02.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会试的 弗朗西斯爵士 基督要我们宽恕所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will try, Sir Francis.Jesus asks us to forgive everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.15,0:26:06.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你玩游戏吗 玛丽女士 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you like games, Lady Mary? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近宫内流行一种新游戏 或许你会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is a new game at court that you might enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.28,0:26:10.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.29,0:26:14.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那叫做"舔阴" 乃是一种古老乡村活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's called cunnilingus. It's an old country practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.16,0:26:17.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 怎么玩法？- 呃 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How do you play it? - Well you...You...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.13,0:26:25.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你是在拿我取乐 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you're making fun of me, Sir Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:39.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.21,0:26:42.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切莫冒犯于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Noli Me Tangere
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:43.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而今已非昔比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can'touch me
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.04,0:26:48.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乌鸦已变凤凰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For Caesar's I am
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.13,0:27:06.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下宣见 拉尔夫·艾列克爵士 约翰·康斯特布尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, Sir Ralph Ellerker and Mr. John Constable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.05,0:27:47.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 我且来问你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, I ask you this:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.24,0:27:51.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世间是否还有王公保护你等安康和平长久如斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What King has kept his subjects so long in wealth and peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.85,0:27:55.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}治下对贵族与平民一视同仁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So ministered justice equally to high and low,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:59.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庇护尔等远离外敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and protected you from all outward enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:03.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已阅尔等降书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have read your submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:08.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你等首先伪称寻求维持信仰 现我告诉你们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your first pretence is that you seek to maintain the faith.But I tell you now gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.93,0:28:12.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有比反叛更违背上帝诫令之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that nothing is more contrary to God's commandment than rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:15.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}针对你等王公暴力起事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rising like madmen against your prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:19.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却丢弃田地荒芜 颗粒无收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}leaving lands untilled and corn unsown is not
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:21.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝非尔等宣称忠良臣民所称行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the behavior of the proper commonwealth you claim to be
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.71,0:28:23.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我感觉被逼迫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}! Your Majesty I feel compelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.42,0:28:27.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噤声 你可是在觐见吾王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hush! You are before the King's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.25,0:28:30.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们恶意曲解我们对教会的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You make false claims about our intentions towards the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:34.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们所做的完全出自约克郡与坎特伯雷教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have done nothing but what the clergy in Yorkand Canterbury
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:36.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同意并完全符合上帝之圣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}agreed was in accordance with God's holy word.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.65,0:28:39.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝之圣言 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God's holy word, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.71,0:28:43.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何该看待你们的逆天而行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So how can the simple people say the contrary?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:47.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣称遵循上帝之诫令而其实一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What presumption and madness is it of them to claim
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.04,0:28:49.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或知之甚少是何等的臆断与疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the knowledge of God's law when they are ignorant
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.32,0:28:54.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又怎能了解自己的本分？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and less knowledgeable and should rather know their duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.64,0:29:08.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们当该已见到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have seen before, in Lincolnshire and elsewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.79,0:29:10.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对林肯郡等地的临时赦免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how temperate and forgiving is our inclination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反叛行为违背上帝意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though rebellion is against God's will,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.10,0:29:18.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本王自心存怜悯 广施慈悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I declare my intention through the pity and compassion of our princely heart
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:21.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赦免所有罪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to pardon all of you who have transgressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.21,0:29:25.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但限立即放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on condition that you now lay down your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.57,0:29:28.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵大人明日将前赴约克郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Grace the Duke of Suffolkwill come North again to Yorkshire
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.43,0:29:30.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与尔等安排会面讲和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to moderate with you and make peace
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:33.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并见证你们遣散诸等事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see you disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.65,0:29:37.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.40,0:29:59.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.77,0:30:06.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人应该知道 我们求恩巡礼武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace should know our army of pilgrims will not disperse
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:09.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不会仅仅一个宽恕的许诺而就此遣散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just for the promise of a pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.17,0:30:13.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求恩行动远远未了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our pilgrimage is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.44,0:30:16.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然知道 也与陛下谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do know.And I have told the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.09,0:30:19.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也是派我来进一步商谈的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why he has given me permission to negotiate with you further.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.40,0:30:21.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满怀诚信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:24.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们请愿书内容的基础上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the basis of our petition?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.88,0:30:25.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.12,0:30:29.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵阁下是否坦诚宣誓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does Your Grace have some token of this "good faith"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.21,0:30:31.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道你不相信我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't trust my word?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.09,0:30:33.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是为了我 是为了阿斯克首领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not for me, for our Captain Mr. Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.84,0:30:35.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他乃律师出身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:39.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此乃出自陛下亲笔的书面允诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is a promise.in his Majesty's own hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.65,0:30:44.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内容坦诚 公允 合理 因为吾王挚爱其子民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to deal with you openly, fairly and reasonably,as his loving subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.65,0:30:53.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们感激陛下恩典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are grateful and abundant to His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.16,0:30:57.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night, Gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.20,0:31:10.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此函交予兰开夏郡传令官 立即送去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is for the Lancashire Herald.See that it is dispatched immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:45.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康斯特布尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Constable...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.07,0:31:51.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您切莫相信克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you, do not put your trustin Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.88,0:32:01.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢上帝 陛下 您今天真是宽宏大量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thank God and Your Majesty for your great mercy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:05.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为您是最仁慈的君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you are the kindest of rulers,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.28,0:32:09.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全心全意希望世人皆知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I wish with all my heart the world knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.76,0:32:12.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世人只是选择他们想听的而已 珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The world chooses what it wants to know, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.89,0:32:15.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但您可改变世人心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you can change its mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:17.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您恢复并保留修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you to restore and keep the abbeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.97,0:32:19.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jane...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.87,0:32:24.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想世人所想 倾听一下你的人民和你的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think what the world will think.That you listened to your people and to your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.44,0:32:25.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jane...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.91,0:32:27.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾经告诫过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've told you once before:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.81,0:32:31.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切勿干预我的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't to meddle with my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.76,0:32:36.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否记得上任王后发生何事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you remember what happened to the late Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:40.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.31,0:32:47.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你甚过她 也甚过于凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you more than her.More even than Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.11,0:32:53.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千万别恃宠过度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.03,0:33:14.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波尔红衣主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.11,0:33:20.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是迭伊哥·胡尔塔多·门多萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My name is Diego Hurtado de Mendoza
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.21,0:33:24.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些先生们乃吾皇查尔斯五世陛下之顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and these gentlemen are all advisers to His Imperial Majesty, King Charles V.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.50,0:33:26.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:31.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我随身带来教皇陛下使节命封在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I carry this letter of legatine authority from his Holiness Pope Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.72,0:33:33.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we be seated?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.79,0:33:45.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们听说您要前来 但请恕我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were aware, Eminence, that you were on your way here.But, forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.46,0:33:49.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尚不了解您此番前来的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we remaina little unsure as to the exact nature of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:54.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你们都已了解全英爆发之反王起义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure you are aware of the risings which have taken place across England against the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:57.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其针对邪教徒克伦威尔及其党羽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that heretic Cromwell and all his sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.71,0:34:03.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得知此事的一些情报 我们当然很关注此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have heard some information, certainly. And naturally we are intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:10.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些起义正是我们重还英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These popular risings are the greatest chance that we may ever have
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.01,0:34:13.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正信仰的绝佳机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to restore the true religion to England,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.22,0:34:16.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这些我国信徒同胞需要支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the faithful people of my country need support.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:20.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你我每个人 门多萨先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each of us, senor Mendoza,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.78,0:34:27.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都需要以各自的方式 去鼓励 持续发展壮大这股力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in our own way must encourage the risings to continue and to grow in strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:38.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使这意味着最终导致颠覆国王吗 而并非他的邪恶阁员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if that means the overthrow of the King himself,not just his wicked council?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.74,0:34:40.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.50,0:34:45.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以大胆的如此设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can imagine such an outcome without fear
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.92,0:34:50.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为另有位怀有真正信仰的王位合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for there is another, close to the throne,with a legitimate claim and a true faith:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.27,0:34:54.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.30,0:34:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果她不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If not her,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.80,0:35:02.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一位天主教徒具有登基之合法性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is still another Catholic with a legitimate claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.58,0:35:05.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位先于都铎王朝就统治过王国的安茹王朝后裔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A scion of the Plantagenets,who ruled before the Tudors,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.54,0:35:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会很乐意登基大统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would gladly rule after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:11.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您指谁 红衣主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of whom do you speak, Your Eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:19.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我指我本人 门多萨先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I speak of myself, senor Mendoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.57,0:35:29.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拉尔夫 约翰 我们都在为你们祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ralph...John! We have waited and prayed for your
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.63,0:35:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你们安全返回 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}safe return.Thank God! Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:35.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王很仁慈 许诺大赦天下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King in his mercy has offered us a general pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:39.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并派沙福克公爵前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is also sending the Duke of Suffolk to negotiate and treat with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.84,0:35:43.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们请愿书的基础上无先决条件的与我们磋商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without preconditions and on the basis of our demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.99,0:35:49.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 当真？- 是的 我相信国王的真诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Is it true? - I trust the King's good faith and mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.95,0:35:54.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有书面为证 我们将再次在此会晤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and here's the proof of it.We are to meet again here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:03.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你未发一言 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not said anything yet, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.38,0:36:06.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否与拉尔夫爵士意见相左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it because you do not agree with Sir Ralph?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.21,0:36:09.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 我无法相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I cannot agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.59,0:36:13.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么相信 那个邪恶的克伦威尔依然在当政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How should I agree when I think that devil Cromwell has such a hold over the King
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.86,0:36:17.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些许诺就一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I account these promises to be utterly worthless!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:19.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为我们不该和他们商谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't think we should meet with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.27,0:36:21.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想目前暂且不谈 我们应当戳穿他们的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I don't. We should expose their lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.86,0:36:24.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来一次全面出击 夺取整个英国北部地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call a general muster,take the entire of the North
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.92,0:36:29.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}届时再行谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and only then condescend to a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.51,0:36:32.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你凭什么认为他们的话不可置信呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you so sure that their word is not to be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:35.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 看看这个 - 那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Because of this. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.36,0:36:40.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一封克伦威尔写过约克郡士绅贵人信件的复制件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A copy of a letter from Cromwell to the Yorkshire gentry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.21,0:36:44.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给你念念这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll read some of it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:47.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"这些叛乱者有望和平遣散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"There is hope they may disperse peacefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.06,0:36:51.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"但仍能死灰复燃 再度非法聚集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"but if these rebels continue with their illegal assemblies
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.63,0:36:57.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"除非以雷霆手段给与严酷镇压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and their defiance then their rebellion will be crushed so forcibly
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:37:00.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"以达威慑所有臣民之功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"that their example shall be fearful to all subjects
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.25,0:37:04.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"唯有如此世界方可持久"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so long as the world does endure."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:12.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"唯有如此世界方可持久" 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"So long as the world does endure", gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.62,0:37:18.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但其实他们镇压不了我们 所以沙福克公爵才被迫来谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the truth is they cannot crush us.And that is why the Duke is forced to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.21,0:37:23.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这么明显的可疑之处你竟然都置之不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This sure sign of their deviousness does not impress you then?...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.17,0:37:29.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说我们先不解除警备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say we do not stop our vigilance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.87,0:37:31.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但准备做好会谈准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But prepare for our meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.98,0:37:33.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明确我们的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}clarify our positions
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.52,0:37:35.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强化我们的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and strengthen our arguments
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.41,0:37:38.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时让我们的教会负责人背书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have our Church leaders endorse them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.37,0:37:49.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我们不必恐惧 约翰 我们就要接近胜利了 - 我知道 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why should we fear, John, when we are about God's work? - I know we are but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.87,0:38:02.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只希望我们当中 或我们的子孙后代 不会以此刻为憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only hope that none of us, nor our grandchildren-ever live to regret this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.12,0:38:05.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你此行顺利 马到成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted to wish you every success for your journey
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.29,0:38:07.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安抚好那些叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and conference with the rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.50,0:38:09.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am grateful to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.06,0:38:13.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我更期望和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I desire more than anything else a peaceful remedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.93,0:38:17.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我许诺你可根据情势自主定夺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have my permission to prolong the truce for as long as necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.83,0:38:22.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也可给与那些反叛分子大赦 但头目们除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may also affirm my general pardon to all the rebels. Except their leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.82,0:38:28.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我依然希望你抓获并绞死他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want them brought to you still,with halters around their necks!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.79,0:38:38.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下知道这些叛军 无疑很明显归罪于克伦威尔大臣阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty knows the rebels, no doubt unjustly, blame Master Cromwell
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.30,0:38:44.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在诸多方面 他们反复重申要求将其革职查办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for many of their actions.Repeatedly they ask for his removal and punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:47.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这方面我该如何回复他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What should I tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.76,0:39:04.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道这个吗 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what this is, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:06.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自新世界的水果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fruit from the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.48,0:39:12.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芳林新时催旧叶 流水前波让后波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}New things come in.Everything changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.58,0:39:15.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很喜欢纳新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a great appetite for novelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.11,0:39:19.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可随意应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell them what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.35,0:39:34.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.43,0:39:38.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我读了你们的请愿书 在诸多条款之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have read your new petition.Among other articles, you ask
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.13,0:39:41.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要求设立召开特别国会会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the setting up of a special convocation or Parliament
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.26,0:39:44.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并要求保证会议不受国王喜恶所左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to debate without fear or his Majesty's displeasure
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.90,0:39:48.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}质询恶行 王室特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}questions of heresy,the royal supremacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.49,0:39:50.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维护信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and maintenance of the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:54.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我先可告知你们 国王非常赞同这个要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can tell you now that the King has graciously conceded to your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.19,0:40:02.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别国会将不在威斯敏斯特举行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A special parliament will be summoned to be held not far away at Westminster
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.75,0:40:07.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是在此地 约克郡来决议所以事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but here in York, to debate and decide on all these questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.77,0:40:15.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 我们还要求废除并焚毁那些路德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you. We have asked for the heresies of Luther,Wycliffe and Tyndaleto
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.71,0:40:18.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威克力夫 丁道尔等人邪教传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be annulled and destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:23.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要求惩处异教徒主教以及教众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have asked that the heretics,bishops and temporal, be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.92,0:40:32.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔 奥德利 理查德·瑞奇爵士 因在国土之内玷污信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That Cromwell, Audley, Sir Richard Rich be punished as subverters of the good laws of this realm
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:35.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并传播邪教受到惩处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and maintainers of false sects.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.21,0:40:37.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个并非我可以决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is not for me to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.57,0:40:40.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管我对此有何感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever my true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.51,0:40:45.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但此项问题正是需要特别国会去制宪并决议的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But such questions are exactly what the special Parliament will be constituted to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.95,0:40:50.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此特别国会是否可以就教皇辖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it possible that this Parliament can also debate the question of papal obedience,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.62,0:40:54.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灵魂救治 玛丽女士王位合法继承权等事宜进行表决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}touching the cure of souls,and the legitimacy of the Lady Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.73,0:40:57.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 阿斯克先生 我可保证上述重大事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Mr. Aske.I can guarantee that all these great matters
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.84,0:41:00.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}均可提交特别国会决议 不受国王喜恶所左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can be put before the Parliament without fear or favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.15,0:41:04.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王是否还愿意实施大赦呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the King is still willing to offer a general pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:08.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但是我说此事略带踌躇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. I say that with hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.22,0:41:12.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王越是了解此番起义的缘由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The more His Majesty understands the causes of this uprising,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.45,0:41:15.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求恩者们对国王本人与其统治的忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the loyalty of the pilgrims to his person and rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:18.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会越发乐意大发慈悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the more is he persuaded to show clemency.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.73,0:41:25.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一重大事宜 公爵大人应当知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one other great matter. Your Grace knows that we demand
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.27,0:41:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们强烈要求镇压修道院的行动应该中止 甚至恢复修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the suppressed abbeys should stand or be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:32.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我们的重点所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is our sticking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.85,0:41:38.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将永远为之献身战斗来维护我们信仰的场所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were always determined to fight and die for the maintenance of our religious houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:41.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此我所能说的是 所有摧毁修道院的行为都将停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I can say about that is that all further destruction of the abbeys
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.03,0:41:44.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留待国会议案处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will cease until Parliament meets.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:51.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国会也将就其他修道院是否恢复 何时恢复进行议案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will then be up to Parliament to decide if and when the others will be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.70,0:41:56.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回家吧 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go home and put aside your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.32,0:42:03.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过我们这次起义 起义的力量 我相信我们已经达到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By standing together and by standing strong, I believe we have achieved
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.03,0:42:09.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们求恩巡礼目的所能取得的最大结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as much as we could have gained when we first took up this great pilgrimage of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.25,0:42:17.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快到圣诞节了 回家去欢庆我主耶稣基督之诞辰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is almost Christmas. Go home and celebrate the birth of our Lord Jesus Christ
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.39,0:42:22.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们感谢上帝 也感谢吾王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thank God as we thank the King's Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.04,0:42:26.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们达到了要求一切 却并未血风腥雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that all this has been achieved without bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.72,0:42:29.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有请国王传令官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please listen to the King's herald.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.19,0:42:39.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王陛下 亨利八世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"His Gracious Majesty King Henry VIII
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.38,0:42:45.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特此谕令大赦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"hereby pardons by royal command all those subjects
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:49.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有参与非法叛乱之臣民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"who have transgressed and risen in unlawful rebellion."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.82,0:42:57.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 我要求所有人就地遣散 回家 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I therefore ask everyone of you to disperse, go home and put aside your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.41,0:43:06.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经确定我们的信仰得到了维护 没有被毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Firm in the knowledge that our faith is to be maintained and not destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.31,0:43:22.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么 丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it, husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.15,0:43:24.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信是来自国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it's from the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那信啥内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.39,0:43:37.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"可信赖及热爱之罗伯特·阿斯克先生台鉴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"My trusty and well beloved Aske. I am informed that,"notwithstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.33,0:43:48.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我获悉尽管您参与近期发生之叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your offences committed against us"in the late rebellion attempted in those parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.03,0:43:54.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"却能迷途知返 并决心做忠实子民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"you are now at heart repentant."And since you are determined to be a faithful subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.82,0:43:58.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我们热切期望与您会谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have conceived a great desire to speak with you..."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.02,0:44:02.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 父亲 - 别吵 孩子们 听你父亲说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Father! - Hush, children, hush! Listen to your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.17,0:44:05.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"听你亲口陈述整桩事变之来龙去脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"And to hear from your mouth the whole circumstance and beginning of that matter."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.43,0:44:09.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王想跟我谈话 你能相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King wants to speak with me. Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.51,0:44:13.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"鉴于我们已经深知您是位忠臣良民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I therefore order you, as our true and faithful subject, as we now repute you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.99,0:44:16.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"现我命你圣诞期间前来宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}" to come to court for Christmastide.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.43,0:44:19.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"此行不宜让别人知晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"You are not to let anyone know,but you will use such plainness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.02,0:44:22.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"相信你坦荡真诚 我们甚为倚重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and frankness in all things we shall demand of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.07,0:44:26.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"或许给予进一步嘉奖"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we may have cause to reward you even further."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.02,0:44:28.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里另有附注保障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is a credence attached
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.63,0:44:32.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"您赴宫廷之约来去安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}saying that "You shall safe come and safe go from court,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.13,0:44:34.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"应与圣诞节第12日回家"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}returning before the twelfth day of Christmas."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.63,0:44:37.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是想确定这是真的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just make sure that he means to honor
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.09,0:44:40.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您真的相信沙福克公爵在邓卡斯特代表陛下的那些承诺？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the promises Lord Suffolk made on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.01,0:44:43.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道国王已经将此事作为心中大事不明摆着吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not obvious that the King has taken this matterto his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.63,0:44:45.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这信件应当是由他亲笔书就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a letter written in his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:48.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您太乐意轻信 这次我不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are still too trusting. I would not go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.45,0:44:50.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们许诺了可以安全返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there is a promise of safe return.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.87,0:44:53.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺言可以被打破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Promises can be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.06,0:44:56.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康斯特布尔先生 国王的金口玉言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Constable, the promisesof a King are worth a great deal
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.25,0:44:58.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远非寻常草木之人言语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more than the promises of ordinary folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.05,0:45:02.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们应当这么做 我将安排联程驿马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's what we shall do:I will arrange to lay post horses
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.30,0:45:04.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这里一直到伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all the way between here and London,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.21,0:45:08.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果一旦发生意外 阿斯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that if God forbid, Mr. Aske,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.57,0:45:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被捕入狱 或被恶意对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you were imprisoned or otherwise badly treated,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.38,0:45:17.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会立即得到消息并聚众重新起事 要求释放您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will hear about it straight away,and raise the people again for your deliverance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.59,0:45:21.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢达西大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Lord, that's it.
